Okay, first to get to that level, you need a potion of enlightenment.  
(the word is always 'e' for the Prince quest)  Then, you need to 
get to experience level 14, and you can go on the quest.  Find your
quest leader, and go after Jaffar.  To open the portal to his sanctum,
stand on the altar square on Tower Level 3, and quaff the potion.
Then go in and kill Jaffar.  Make sure you get the Manual (called the
Tome of the Frequently Asked Question), the quest item, off of his body.  
Then you can continue on your merry way.  But be careful; the WoY loves
to steal that thing.

You can invoke the Tome to get some temporary intrinsics, including
Fire Resistance.

